title: "Voice Authentication System"
abstract: >-
  AI-powered voice biometric authentication using SpeechBrain and ECAPA-TDNN
  for secure speaker verification. A local-first platform that turns voice
  samples into an installable, offline Python SDK with the voiceprint baked in.
